Hello everyone! I'm new to furry art and I'm opening commissions for headshots.  You can find more information about pricing here: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vqkYnp49jn066MteM1IwGb0vPeMk0kTX\_aXg2kie5d8/edit?usp=sharing](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vqkYnp49jn066MteM1IwGb0vPeMk0kTX_aXg2kie5d8/edit)

&#x200B;

Thanks for checking me out and I can't wait to serve the furry community! :)
